{
    "background_story": "In a mystical realm, Blossom was a rare and wondrous being known as a Luminari. She possessed the unique gift of having four hands, each imbued with a different aspect of nature: earth, air, water, and fire. With her earth hand, Blossom could nurture and grow the most vibrant flora. Her air hand allowed her to weave powerful gusts of wind, while her water hand could heal even the most grievous wounds. Her fire hand, however, held the greatest mystery, for it could forge stars and conjure celestial music. As a gentle guardian of the realm, Blossom used her four-handed abilities to maintain harmony and balance. Her presence was a blessing, and her name became synonymous with wonder and magic.",
